 "remarks": "Darling three bedroom ranch on one very private level acre with specimen trees and gardens. Beautiful street and very convenient location. Light, bright and good sized living room w/fireplace and kitchen plus heated sunroom w/built-ins and sliders to back patio. 3rd bedroom w/full bath is over the garage and currently set up as an in-law apartment w/separate entrance. Hardwood floors throughout and lots of vintage charm and character. All new interior & exterior painting and refinished floors. Full unfinished attic w/pull-down stairs and full unfinished basement. Incredible potential for updating and expansion. Large in-ground pool not currently in use being sold as is. Minutes to RT 7, schools, trains, Wilton Center, shops, restaurants. A gem!",
